---
layout: layouts/base.njk
desc: "Sarthak Bichhawa, Sr. Data & Applied Scientist at Microsoft Azure Storage. Explore the work, ask the AI portfolio assistant, and see the evidence."
---

<header class="home-hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <div class="hero-identity"><img src="/assets/sarthak.jpg" alt="" width="56" height="56" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /><p><strong>{{ facts.identity.name }}</strong><span>{{ facts.identity.title }} · {{ facts.identity.org }}</span></p></div>
    <h1 class="hero-title"><span class="sr-only">Sarthak Bichhawa. </span>I make complex systems <em>dependable.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">{{ facts.summary.hero }}</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#assistant">Meet my AI advocate <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="{{ facts.resume.file }}" data-goatcounter-click="hero-resume-pdf">Résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}" data-goatcounter-click="hero-email">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="hero-aside" aria-label="At a glance"><span class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><p>Applied AI.<br />Real systems.<br />Measurable impact.</p><div class="hero-now"><span class="availability-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Open to senior AI & ML roles</div><span class="hero-location">{{ facts.identity.location }} · Previously Walmart Labs</span></aside>
</header>

<section class="home-assistant wrap" id="assistant" aria-labelledby="assistant-heading" data-portfolio-assistant data-site-url="{{ facts.meta.site_url }}" data-availability="checking">
  <div class="assistant-canvas">
    <div class="assistant-intro"><div><p class="assistant-kicker"><span class="assistant-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> AI portfolio assistant</p><h2 id="assistant-heading">The case for Sarthak.</h2></div><p class="assistant-deck">A little help seeing the bigger picture.<br />Ask about Sarthak’s strengths, explore the work, or bring a role.</p></div>
    <div class="portfolio-brief" aria-labelledby="brief-heading">
      <p class="brief-label" id="brief-heading">Portfolio brief <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Curated public facts</p>
      <div class="brief-grid">
        <a href="/case/incident-agent/" class="brief-item"><span class="brief-number">01 / Applied AI</span><h3>He ships the system.</h3><p>Autonomous investigation agents, four reusable MCP servers, and the evaluations behind them.</p><span class="brief-link">See the engineering <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
        <a href="/case/revenue-attribution/" class="brief-item"><span class="brief-number">02 / Business impact</span><h3>He follows through.</h3><p>Recovered ~$45M/mo in partner revenue attribution, then redesigned the engine to make the numbers trustworthy.</p><span class="brief-link">See the recovery <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
        <a href="/resume/#record-walmart" class="brief-item"><span class="brief-number">03 / Leadership</span><h3>He brings people with him.</h3><p>Led a 4-team cross-org response at Microsoft; previously led 4 data scientists and 2 interns at Walmart Labs.</p><span class="brief-link">See the experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="assistant-workspace">
      <div class="assistant-live" id="assistant-live" hidden>
        <div class="assistant-workspace-head"><p class="assistant-welcome" id="assistant-welcome">What should we make the case for?</p><button class="assistant-clear" type="button" id="assistant-clear" disabled>Clear conversation</button></div>
        <div class="assistant-conversation" id="assistant-conversation" role="region" aria-label="Conversation with the AI portfolio assistant" tabindex="0" hidden></div>
        <div class="assistant-modes" role="group" aria-label="Assistant mode"><button type="button" data-assistant-mode="question" aria-pressed="true">Ask a question</button><button type="button" data-assistant-mode="match" aria-pressed="false">Compare a role <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
        <div class="assistant-suggestions" id="assistant-suggestions" aria-label="Suggested questions"><button type="button" data-assistant-prompt="Give me a confident 30-second pitch for Sarthak, backed by his strongest public evidence.">The 30-second pitch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" data-assistant-prompt="Make the case for Sarthak’s ability to ship production LLM agents, using specific evidence.">AI systems shipped <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" data-assistant-prompt="What makes Sarthak a strong technical leader? Back up the case with examples from his public experience.">Why Sarthak? <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
        <form class="assistant-form" id="assistant-form">
          <div id="assistant-question-field" class="assistant-field"><label for="assistant-question">Your question</label><textarea id="assistant-question" name="question" rows="2" maxlength="1200" required placeholder="What makes Sarthak a strong fit for an AI leadership role?" aria-describedby="assistant-input-note assistant-privacy assistant-counter"></textarea></div>
          <div id="assistant-match-field" class="assistant-field" hidden><label for="assistant-job">Public job description</label><textarea id="assistant-job" name="jobDescription" rows="5" maxlength="6000" disabled placeholder="Paste the responsibilities and requirements from a public job posting…" aria-describedby="assistant-input-note assistant-privacy assistant-counter"></textarea></div>
          <div class="assistant-input-meta"><p id="assistant-input-note">Specific questions get the most useful answers.</p><span id="assistant-counter">0 / 1,200</span></div>
          <div class="assistant-submit-row"><p class="assistant-privacy" id="assistant-privacy">Public information only. Your text is sent to OpenAI when you send. <a href="/colophon/#assistant-privacy">Privacy details</a></p><button class="assistant-cancel" id="assistant-cancel" type="button" hidden>Stop</button><button class="assistant-send" id="assistant-send" type="submit" disabled><span id="assistant-send-label">Ask the assistant</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div class="assistant-status-row"><span class="assistant-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p id="assistant-status" class="assistant-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Checking AI availability. The public brief above is ready to explore.</p><a class="assistant-fallback-link" href="/resume/">Read the full résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <details class="assistant-about"><summary>About this AI advocate</summary><div><p>The brief above is curated website content. Live replies come from an AI portfolio assistant, not Sarthak speaking or a personal reference. It makes the strongest case supported by approved public résumé and portfolio facts, dated {{ facts.meta.resume_rev }}, with evidence links and honest gaps. Role comparisons never invent a match score.</p><p>Nothing is sent to the model until you choose to send. Only public questions and public job descriptions belong here; do not include personal or confidential information. The server sends your text and up to two earlier questions to OpenAI. Conversation history stays in this tab and clears on reload or “Clear conversation.” <a href="/colophon/#assistant-privacy">Processing and privacy details</a>. Replies may contain errors; check the linked sources.</p></div></details>
      <noscript><p class="assistant-no-script">Live AI needs JavaScript. The public brief, <a href="/case/">case studies</a>, and <a href="/resume/">résumé</a> are ready to explore.</p></noscript>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section wrap" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
  <div class="home-section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A few things I’ve built</p><h2 id="work-heading">Selected work.</h2></div><a href="/case/" class="text-link">All six case studies <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <div class="project-grid">
    <article class="project-card"><div class="project-top"><p class="eyebrow">AI & agents</p><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3><a href="/case/incident-agent/">An investigator <br />that shows its work.</a></h3><p>An autonomous planner / executor loop turns live telemetry into a cited investigation brief.</p><div class="project-outcome"><strong>{{ facts.receipts[2].value }}</strong><span>On-call incident diagnosis</span></div><a class="project-read" href="/case/incident-agent/">Inside the incident agent <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article class="project-card"><div class="project-top"><p class="eyebrow">Revenue systems</p><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3><a href="/case/revenue-attribution/">The numbers <br />needed a detective.</a></h3><p>A silent attribution failure on a $5B+/yr platform. A recovery, a redesign, and &lt;1% variance vs Finance.</p><div class="project-outcome"><strong>{{ facts.receipts[0].value }}</strong><span>Partner revenue attribution recovered</span></div><a class="project-read" href="/case/revenue-attribution/">Inside the recovery <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article class="project-card"><div class="project-top"><p class="eyebrow">Customer intelligence</p><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3><a href="/case/customer-health-agent/">A question. <br />A review-ready answer.</a></h3><p>Plain English becomes governed live queries and customer-health narratives across 13 metric domains.</p><div class="project-outcome"><strong>{{ facts.receipts[3].value }}</strong><span>Executive-review preparation</span></div><a class="project-read" href="/case/customer-health-agent/">Inside the health agent <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
  </div>
  <div class="more-work"><span>Also in the portfolio</span><a href="/case/data-trust/">Data trust <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/case/account2vec/">Account embeddings <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/case/stress-lab/">Adaptive testing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</section>

<section class="home-section wrap" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
  <div class="experience-story"><div><p class="eyebrow">The through line</p><h2 id="experience-heading">Build it. Own it.<br />Bring the team.</h2></div><div><p>From production ML at Walmart Labs to applied AI and revenue-critical systems at Azure Storage, I work where the model meets the messy reality of production.</p><p>That means tracing failures, building trust in the data, and aligning people around systems they can depend on.</p><a href="/resume/" class="text-link">Explore my experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
  <ol class="career-strip" aria-label="Career history">{% for role in facts.record %}<li><a href="/resume/#{{ role.id }}"><strong>{{ role.company }}</strong><span>{{ role.dates }}</span></a></li>{% endfor %}</ol>
</section>

<section class="home-section wrap home-writing" id="writing" aria-labelledby="writing-heading"><div class="home-section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Things I’ve learned along the way</p><h2 id="writing-heading">Field notes.</h2></div><a href="/writing/" class="text-link">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><ul class="posts">{% for w in facts.writing %}{% if w.url %}<li><a class="post-row" href="{{ w.url }}"><span class="post-date">{{ w.date | humanDate }}</span><span class="post-title">{{ w.title }}</span><span class="post-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></section>

<section class="home-contact wrap" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading"><div class="contact-panel"><div class="contact-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Have something in mind?</p><h2 id="contact-heading">Let’s make it work.</h2><p>Open to senior opportunities in applied AI and ML leadership.</p></div><a href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}" class="contact-arrow" aria-label="Email Sarthak" data-goatcounter-click="contact-email">↗</a></div><div class="contact-links"><a href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}">{{ facts.identity.email }}</a><a href="{{ facts.identity.linkedin }}">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="{{ facts.identity.github }}">GitHub ↗</a><a href="{{ facts.resume.file }}">Résumé (PDF) ↗</a></div><details class="disclosure"><summary>Plain-text summary, for your notes</summary><div class="disclosure-body"><pre id="ats-summary">{{ facts.summary.ats }}
